# Copy to Railway's Variables tab (or a local .env for testing).
#
# Everything in run_bot.py already has a baked-in default matching this file
# -- for a Railway deploy you only need to set the "REQUIRED" block below
# (your OKX API keys + Telegram token). Uncomment anything else only if you
# want to override its default.

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# REQUIRED — set these in Railway; everything else is already defaulted
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# --- OKX live credentials (leave unset / PAPER=true to stay in paper mode
#     even with these filled in -- see PAPER note below) ---
OKX_API_KEY=
OKX_API_SECRET=
OKX_API_PASSWORD=

# --- Telegram alerts + /stats /status /positions /log /stop commands ---
TELEGRAM_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OPTIONAL — already the code default, only set to override
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# EXCHANGE_ID=okx
#
# TIMEFRAME: any ccxt bar size (15m, 30m, 1h, ...). Indicator periods (HMA20,
# EMA5/9, ROC9, RSI14, ADX14, ATR14, VolSMA20) are bar counts and stay the
# same numbers on any timeframe -- 15m just covers half the lookback of 30m,
# so expect faster/noisier signals. Run one timeframe per deployment.
# TIMEFRAME=30m
#
# Watchlist: BTC, ETH, SOL, XRP, gold (XAU), silver (XAG) OKX USDT perpetuals.
# MAX_OPEN_POSITIONS=2 below still caps concurrent trades to 2 even though 6
# symbols are watched -- whichever 2 get a valid setup first hold the slots.
# SYMBOLS=BTC/USDT:USDT,ETH/USDT:USDT,SOL/USDT:USDT,XRP/USDT:USDT,XAU/USDT:USDT,XAG/USDT:USDT
#
# MARGIN_MODE=cross
#
# LEVERAGE scales position size: notional/trade = BALANCE * MARGIN_FRACTION *
# LEVERAGE. At 20x with MARGIN_FRACTION=0.05 that's ~100% of balance notional
# per trade -- confirm this is intended before deploying live.
# LEVERAGE=20

# --- Mode ---
# PAPER stays "true" even once the OKX keys above are filled in -- the bot
# will NOT place real orders (and won't even attach the keys to the exchange
# client) until you explicitly set PAPER=false here.
# PAPER=true
#
# BALANCE seeds the PAPER simulator only. In LIVE mode (PAPER=false) the bot
# fetches your real OKX account balance instead and ignores this value.
# BALANCE=10000

# --- Risk (RiskManager) ---
# MARGIN_FRACTION=0.05
# MAX_OPEN_POSITIONS=2
# MAX_DRAWDOWN_PCT=0.15

# --- Polling ---
# POLL_SECONDS=20
